Question:  Given a table with id, name,dept ,salary. Find the highest salary in each department

SELECT dept, MAX(salary) AS HighestSalary
FROM Employees
GROUP BY dept;

OR

SELECT e1.id, e1.name, e1.dept, e1.salary
FROM Employees e1
WHERE e1.salary = (
    SELECT MAX(e2.salary)
    FROM Employees e2
    WHERE e2.dept = e1.dept
);

